    // Fix 2026-08-27: replaces the old dynasty-TradeValue-shaped OffSeasonPlayerDto
    // for the redraft board. RedraftSimDto mirrors the subset of SimRow fields
    // (RedraftRankings.razor) this page needs; RedraftBoardPlayerDto is the
    // post-projection, ranked shape the table binds to.
    // 2026-09-07: Mean added. This board sorted on Median, and 09-06 measured
    // Median as a position-dependent 89-94% of Mean (RB 89.2, TE 90.1, QB 93.7,
    // WR 94.3) — so the ordering was biased hardest against the two positions
    // you draft earliest. Reads guard `Mean > 0 ? Mean : Median`, the same
    // guard shipped everywhere else on 09-06, so legacy rows still render.
    private record RedraftSimDto(string SleeperPlayerId, string PlayerName, string Position, string? NflTeam, decimal Median, decimal Mean);

